---
interface Props {
  className?: string;
  condensed?: boolean;
}

const { className = '', condensed = false } = Astro.props;
---

<section class={`bg-gradient-to-br from-[#FAF7F2] via-white to-blue-50/40 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-10 border border-[#E6DFD3] shadow-sm my-10 ${className}`}>
  
  <!-- Header: International Certification -->
  <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-10">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200/90 text-emerald-800 text-xs font-bold tracking-wide uppercase mb-3">
      <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4M7.835 4.697a3.42 3.42 0 001.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 014.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 001.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 013.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010 4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-4.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138-3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010-4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 013.138-3.138z" />
      </svg>
      <span>Internationally Certified • Borderless Virtual Practice</span>
    </div>

    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-[#0A233F] tracking-tight font-serif mb-3">
      How We Work With Global Families &amp; Our Clinical Scope
    </h2>
    <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
      Led by <strong>Ms. Rabbia Ashraf</strong> (MS Clinical Psychology, Certified ADOS-2 Autism Practitioner), our virtual clinic provides direct, evidence-based parent guidance across the UK, USA, Gulf, Australia, Canada, and Pakistan. Here is our exact, disciplined 4-step workflow and our clear legal boundaries.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- The 4-Step Disciplined Workflow -->
  <div class="mb-12">
    <div class="text-xs font-bold text-blue-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-4 text-center">
      4-Step Clinical Discipline: From Booking to Home Results
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
      
      <!-- Step 1 -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 border border-gray-200/80 shadow-2xs relative">
        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 text-brand-navy font-bold flex items-center justify-center text-sm mb-3">
          1
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-[#0A233F] mb-1.5">Intake &amp; Document Drop</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          Share your child's age, primary behavioral hurdles, and optionally upload previous school notes or psychological reports for pre-call clinical review.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2 -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 border border-gray-200/80 shadow-2xs relative">
        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 text-emerald-800 font-bold flex items-center justify-center text-sm mb-3">
          2
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-[#0A233F] mb-1.5">50-Min Video Strategy Call</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          Private, 1-on-1 parent consultation using our <strong>Off-Screen Child Protocol</strong>—enabling you to speak freely without distressing your child.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3 -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 border border-gray-200/80 shadow-2xs relative">
        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-purple-50 border border-purple-200 text-purple-800 font-bold flex items-center justify-center text-sm mb-3">
          3
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-[#0A233F] mb-1.5">24-Hour Action Roadmap</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          Receive a tailored, 3-step written action plan with morning/evening visual routines, sensory de-escalation strategies, and school communication scripts.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 4 -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 border border-gray-200/80 shadow-2xs relative">
        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 text-amber-900 font-bold flex items-center justify-center text-sm mb-3">
          4
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-[#0A233F] mb-1.5">Between-Session Check-in</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          Never left stuck with a document. Access ongoing implementation check-ins and structured programs to refine strategies as your child progresses.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- The Legal Scope & Zero-Liability Protection Shield -->
  <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-gray-200 shadow-2xs">
    <div class="flex items-start gap-3 mb-4">
      <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-slate-100 border border-slate-300 text-slate-700 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#0A233F]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-[#0A233F]">
          Our Clinical Scope &amp; Legal Protection Shield
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">
          How our parent-mediated consultative model protects both your family and our international practice:
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 text-xs sm:text-sm">
      
      <div class="bg-gray-50/80 rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-200/80">
        <strong class="font-bold text-[#0A233F] block mb-1">1. Parent-Mediated Coaching Model</strong>
        <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-xs">
          Our client is the adult parent or caregiver. We provide behavioral coaching, developmental education, and routine planning—not statutory tele-diagnosis or psychiatric medication.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gray-50/80 rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-200/80">
        <strong class="font-bold text-[#0A233F] block mb-1">2. No Statutory Diagnosis Substitute</strong>
        <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-xs">
          Consultations do not replace statutory local evaluations (such as UK NHS EHCPs, Australian NDIS determinations, or US school 504 plans), which remain the jurisdiction of in-person local medical teams.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gray-50/80 rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-200/80">
        <strong class="font-bold text-[#0A233F] block mb-1">3. Planned Outpatient / Non-Emergency</strong>
        <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-xs">
          We do not provide acute crisis, self-harm, or emergency psychiatric intervention. Immediate emergencies must be directed to local emergency services (999, 911, 000, 112) or local hospital ERs.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-gray-100 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 text-[11px] text-gray-500">
      <span>Contractually governed by client terms of service and informed digital consent.</span>
      <a href="/terms-and-disclaimer/" class="text-blue-700 hover:underline font-semibold">View Full Terms &amp; Professional Disclaimers →</a>
    </div>
  </div>

</section>
